1. Criar e selecionar o banco
---
CREATE DATABASE IF NOT EXISTS db_tcgpokemon_cards;
USE db_tcgpokemon_cards;

---
2. Criar tabelas base (sem dependências)

Ordem importa por causa das chaves estrangeiras.

Tipos
CREATE TABLE tbl_types (
    id INT AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,
    name VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL UNIQUE
);
Estágios
CREATE TABLE tbl_stages (
    id INT AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,
    name VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL UNIQUE
);
Coleções (connections)
CREATE TABLE tbl_connections (
    id INT AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,
    name VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL
);

---
3. Criar tabela principal (com FKs)
CREATE TABLE tbl_cards (
    id INT AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,
    hp INT,
    name VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,
    type_id INT,
    stage_id INT,
    info TEXT,
    attack VARCHAR(100),
    damage VARCHAR(10),
    weak VARCHAR(50),
    resistance VARCHAR(50),
    retreat INT,
    cardNumberInCollection INT,
    connection_id INT,

    FOREIGN KEY (type_id) REFERENCES tbl_types(id),
    FOREIGN KEY (stage_id) REFERENCES tbl_stages(id),
    FOREIGN KEY (connection_id) REFERENCES tbl_connections(id)
);

---
4. Inserir dados base (obrigatório antes dos cards)

Sem isso, os INSERT de cards quebram por causa das FKs.

Tipos

INSERT INTO tbl_types (name) VALUES
('Grass'), ('Fire'), ('Water'), ('Lightning'), ('Psychic'),
('Fighting'), ('Fairy'), ('Normal'), ('Ghost'), ('Dragon'), ('Colorless');
Estágios
